los: the published manifest no longer matches system/contracts/manifest-contract.yaml (declared v15).
  schema at /ai_actions/requests/0/id: 's04b-s16-prepare-1' does not match '^ai-request-[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*$'
A change to the published shape is an interface change, even when it only adds a key: consumers declare an exact version and fail closed.
  1. python tools/manifest_contract.py --bump --note "<what changed>"
  2. mirror the new version into the UI in the same change — contracts/manifest-v<N>.lock.json, MANIFEST_CONTRACT_VERSION, ManifestV<N>, fixture-vault/generated/manifest.json
